# "Mark all read" while the list's own read of the relay is still running. On the device opening WhatsApp joins Wi-Fi and reads the relay:
# 2 to 6 s. A tap on Mark all read in that time must leave the messages gone and the badge 0 when the read lands.
wait 2500               # the launcher's own relay read (1.5 s after it came up): the WhatsApp badge
shot markall-race-before
wifi slow 3000          # from here every request takes 3 s
tap 438 248             # WhatsApp: the saved list at once, its read starts
wait 600
tap 270 918             # Mark all read, the read still running: back to the launcher
wait 30000              # the read lands (its two requests and the dismiss: 9 s in real time), then the worker clears
wifi slow 0
tap 438 248             # WhatsApp again: nothing left
wait 1500
expect-state rows=0
back                    # the launcher reads the badges again: none on WhatsApp
wait 900
shot markall-race-badge
